window.products.push({"id":823235,"name":"GreenPan Treviso Stainless Steel Healthy Ceramic Nonstick, 10 Piece Cookware Pots and Pans Set, PFAS-Free, Clad, Induction, Dishwasher Safe, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJC8ozWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add style to the recipe with The Treviso Collection. Crafted from stainless steel and finished with an encapsulated base, this collection delivers outstanding heat transfer and stunning performance. These pans are finished with our diamond-reinforced ceramic nonstick coating for unparalleled performance and effortless cleanup. The perfect fried egg, crispy shrimp, mouthwatering seared meat or your homemade pan pizza—everything’s easy to transfer with the drip-free pouring rims. The sturdy stainless steel handles give you total control and the tempered glass lids give you an easy view of your meal in progress. Dishwasher safe. Oven safe to 600°F, lids up to 425˚F. Limited lifetime warranty. Set includes: 8” and 9.5” frying pans, 1QT and 2QT saucepans with lids, 3QT sauté pan with lid, 5QT stock pot with lid, and Renew sponge \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJC8ozWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenPan","source_asin":"B09KHYJ55V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KHYJ55V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KHYJ55V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823236,"name":"FOHERE Meat Slicer for Home Use, 200W Electric Deli Food Slicer with Removable Two 7.5” Blades, 0-15 Precise Thickness Knob Cut Deli Food, Meat Ham Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OAKsqjW8L._AC_SL1398_.jpg","description":"【UPGRADE PRO MEAT SLICER】Upgraded blade is sharper, stronger and more durable. Equipped with Two upgrade 304 stainless steel blades(serrated+non-serrated), which cuts cooked food and raw food more healthily, reducing the trouble of cross infection between raw and cooked food. 【200W POWERFUL】The updated electric food slicer is powered by a 200W fast, high-yield slicing power supply that is enough power and speed to cut almost anything, not only meat, jerky, but cheese, bread, and vegetables in a short amount of time, making it easy for you to quickly cook food at home. 【PRECISE SLICE】 Built-in thickness control knob can adjust around 0-15mm for vegetables, meat, roasts, bread, and more. The food slicer can help you to slice efficiently and easily with the precision you need. Makes your work in the kitchen easier. 【DURABLE & COMPACT DESIGN】The electric meat slicer is made of high-quality die-cast aluminum, which is durable, rust-proof and easy to clean. Compact design (15.74*9.84*9.84inch), ideal for most cabinets and tabletops at home, saving space. 【SAFETY PROTECTION】 Non-slip suction feet ensure this deli food slicer stay in place stably while you are operating. Food pusher also acts as a blade guard to help keep your fingers safe. Inner ON/OFF switch offers even more safety insurance. So you can use this slicer machine at home with confidence. (Blades run slower for better cutting results and better machine protection for longer machine life). 【EASY TO CLEAN】Seamless and removable features make sanitation a breeze. Our removable ring-guard cover prevents debris buildup on cutting surfaces. The blade, food carriage and food pusher are removable, it allows for thorough cleaning and sanitation. 【COMPATIBLE BLADES AVAILABLE】If you want to order more different blades individually, both serrated and smooth, you can find them in our store. 24/7 customer support. 【200W POWERFUL MEAT SLICER】The electric slicer is driven by 200 watts of fast, high yield slicing power. This is a highly versatile model, with enough power and speed to slice pretty much anything. Not just meats, but cheeses, bread, and vegetables. 【PRECISE ADJUSTABLE THICKNESS】This home slicer built-in thickness control knob can adjust around 3/4-inch for vegetables, meat, roasts, bread, and more. It can help you slice efficiently and makes it easy to achieve the precision you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OAKsqjW8L._AC_SL1398_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOHERE","source_asin":"B0B179GY5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B179GY5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B179GY5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823237,"name":"Almond Blossoms Artwork by Vincent van Gogh, 24 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vpfZBTXqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features almond flowers. Vincent van Gogh was a Duth post-impressionist painter whose work, notable for its rough beauty, emotional honesty and bold color, had a far-reaching influence on 20th-century art. He sold only one painting during his lifetime, and was little known to the art world at the time of his death, but his fame grew rapidly thereafter. His influence on Expressionism, Fauvism and early abstraction was enormous, and it can be seen in many other aspects of 20th-century art. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vpfZBTXqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00FN05GSI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FN05GSI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FN05GSI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
