window.products.push({"id":823249,"name":"Shower Caddy Bathroom Organizer With Hooks, Adhesive Wall Mounted Bathroom Shower Organizer, SUS304 Stainless Steel Bathroom Shelves With Soap Holders","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JdqRr9PeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUS304 Stainless Steel Durable 304 Stainless Steel: BesChase shower shelves are made of upgraded stainless steel, rust-proof and durable. The hollowed design at the bottom of the shelf can help drain and dry quickly, avoiding harmful substances in humid environments. You can maximize the use of your bathroom space to make it look more spacious and modern. Sturdy Adhesive And Wall Mounted Installation: This set of bathroom shevles come with upgraded traceless adhesive to securely stick the shelf on smooth wall surface without damaging. At the same time, the shower shelves can also be screwed and installed on the rough surface wall, so that the storage baskets can be attached more safely and firmly. Accessible Shelf And Soap Holder: Both the shelf and soap holder are within reach and can be used in the kitchen, bathroom and toilet respectively. They provide large storage for shower accessories, kitchen spice rack and seasoning and toilet paper, aromatherapy, disinfectant, air fresheners, etc. Humanized Design: Deep baskets can hold more shower essentials and prevent the items from falling down. The fuctional hanging hooks on the shelf can hold razors, towels and bath balls, etc. Also the curved corners prevent accidental scratches. Customer Satisfaction Service: BesChase provides professional customer service before and after purchase. If you have any problems or suggestions about our products, please do not hesitate to contact BesChase customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JdqRr9PeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BesChase","source_asin":"B0BWMR2K83","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMR2K83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMR2K83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
