window.products.push({"id":823256,"name":"Nipply Christmas Holiday Kitchen Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rFpMfqcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This RubiaRojo FLOUR SACK HOLIDAY DISH TOWEL puts the fun in functional decorative towels. Reminiscent of Swedish dishcloths that do such a good job in the kitchen, this hand towel is made of quality 100% cotton white flour sack for the fabric's utilitarian, durable and fast-drying features. The difference is that our towels were created to be reusable, not disposable. Each will stand up to many washings. You won’t want to wait to pull these out every December. Fold them over the handle on your dishwasher or range, hang them on a hook from the integrated hanger loop, or use them as placemats under dishes. Regardless, these funny towels make great holiday decor. Although billed primarily as a kitchen towel, this could be a great addition to a guest bathroom. Very few functional decorations work well in both rooms equally. The screen-printed embellishments in red ink on white cloth will stand out as funny and sarcastic cloths in the way you intend. They will look good with traditional red and green Christmas decor. If you enjoy going a little off the mainstream for holidays these are the dishtowels for you. This brand is more exclusive than those you can pick up for a dollar at your local clearance store. It will be obvious that you took some time finding these towels just as you do with everything in your home. Toss this into your cart before Santa comes down your chimney!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rFpMfqcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RubiaRojo","source_asin":"B09F2RCKCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F2RCKCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F2RCKCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823257,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Toasters Best Rated Prime Retro Stainless Steel Toaster with 7 Bread Shade Settings,Bagel/Defrost/Cancel Button,Bread Toaster with Ext","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDDIfUpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are You Frequently Rushing out House for Working in the Morning and Forgetting about Making Your Breakfast? ✌The 2 slice Toaster Fast Heating, Time Saving When the energy-efficient toaster heating two slices of bread to a lovely golden brown. Now, It`s High Time That You Prepared a Delicious Breakfast by Adding a Toaster for Your Family! Specific Functions: 1,Bagel Technology:Press the BAGEL button.The bagel indicator will light up.Ensure bagel does not burn.Toast only one side, while warming the outside, of a cut bagel, English muffin or bun with the bagel setting.  2,Defrost: This toaster can defrost frozen bread before toasting if needed. 3,Cancel: press the CANCEL button to stop toasting if you want. This button can be pressed at any time if necessary. How to Use the Toaster? 1.insert the plug into a suitable mains supply socket and turn the power on  2.Place two slices bread,muffins or bagels into the bread slots. 3.Select the desired browning setting,from No.7 on the browning control knob(No.1-lightest, No.7-darkest). Different types of bread and personal preference may require a different browning setting. 4.Press the carriage control lever down until it clicks into place. Toasting cycle will automatically commence. Slice BagelToaster Specification: The Toaster Rated Power: 850W The Toaster 2 Slice Rated Voltage: 120V The Stainless Steel Toaster Slot width:1.5\"(LxW) The Bagel Toaster Size:9.5\"x6.2\"x7\" (LxWxH) Note For first use, because of the machine oil, it is normal thatthere may be some chemical smell which will dissipate in the future use. Wesuggest toasting without bread for a few minutes during the first use of thebread toaster. To prevent electric shock ,disconnect from the mains before removing cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDDIfUpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iFedio","source_asin":"B09FXJGR1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FXJGR1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FXJGR1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
