window.products.push({"id":823308,"name":"Kitchen Knife Sharpener - 3-Stage Knife Sharpening Tool Helps Repair, Restore and Polish Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jj3aDj51L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Wonderful Kitchen with Fantech Knife Sharpener  Are you ready for a simple-to-use professional quality sharpener for all your knives? We thought so. That is why we here at Sinotron Kitchen have taken the extra care in developing the perfect answer to your dull blade issues.   Work Smarter in the Kitchen  A sharp knife definitely speeds up prep work in the kitchen. You can give life to all your knife very easy by running the knife through this pocket knife sharpener every time you use.   3-Stage Knife Sharpening System  Our 3-Stage system begins with a tungsten sharpening slot that gently repairs damaged blades. Next, diamond steel provides general sharpening before the 3rd slot creates a stunning polish.   Easy to Use Just run the knife through each slot a few times to reveal a razor-sharp knife.   Non-slip Rubber Base  The ceramic knife sharpener has a non-slip base that keeps it sturdy while you slide the knife blades into the sharpening slots.   Ergonomic Handle Design  The handle of the ceramic sharpener is non-slip and ergonomically designed, and it provides you with a secure and comfortable grip.   Premium Quality  This professional knife sharpener is crafted from solid ABS plastic, it's strong, durable and designed to last a lifetime. Caution:  Stage 1: Coarse abrasives for sharpening and repairing dull knife blades with minimal metal removal to restore its V-shape bevel edge.   Stage 2: Diamond abrasive shapes even finer facets on both sides of the blade which further polishes the micro-grooves and creates a 15 degree angle with unprecedented sharpness, prolonged durability.   Stage 3: Premium Edge-honing Fine ceramic for light touch-ups and a smooth burr-free fine edge, extending the life of fine knives.Stage 4:Be sure to remember one direction only，Do not mover backward & forward！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jj3aDj51L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantech","source_asin":"B07Q11WM74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q11WM74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q11WM74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
