window.products.push({"id":823312,"name":"SPT SU-2628BA: Dual Mist Humidifier with ION Exchange Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MM6qvRksL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Effectively relieve dry nose, throat lips and itchy skin with the virtually silent Dual Mist Humidifier with ION exchange filter. Will help you breathe easier and sleep more comfortably. This ultrasonic humidifier disperses warm or cool mist. Sleek design with easy to use control knobs. Subtle light of seven different colors promotes a calming and relaxing environment. The brightness of the light can be adjusted. Large, transparent blue water tank with easy-carrying handle. ION exchange filter demineralizes and treats water to reduce scale-forming calcium and magnesium from hard water. This prolongs the life of the ultrasonic generator and prevents white dust particles to deposit into the air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MM6qvRksL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPT","source_asin":"B09BX6MR4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BX6MR4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BX6MR4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
