window.products.push({"id":823314,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Smooth Edge Electric Can Opener,Full Automatic Hands Free Can Opener, Kitchen Gadget for Arthritis & Seniors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Fe6oZAwzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Our can opener is ergonomically designed with high quality ABS material ,TPE and stainless steel cutting knives. It is high in hardness, corrosion resistant, easy to clean, and can be in contact with food, non-toxic and safe, safe and healthy. With just to start and stop whenever you want, the Electric Can Opener automatically opens your cans in seconds. ✍Understand structural perception ↪Embedded blade The can opener has a sharp blade and is securely embedded in the device to help prevent accidental cuts of fingers when searching for tools in the kitchen drawer. ↪Cutting gear The can opener uses the latest technology. To open the can, position the edge of the can between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the edge of the can through the can opener, moving itself to a full 360° circle. ↪Separate button The can opener has only one button, and the simple and clear operation can be easily used by anyone. ✍How to operate a can opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can ✍Trouble Shooting ⓐ If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. ⓑCans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. ⓒIf the can is get stuck, please press the gray button on the top of the can opener.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Fe6oZAwzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DouHapy","source_asin":"B08DQK76Q1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DQK76Q1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DQK76Q1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
