window.products.push({"id":823400,"name":"Deconovo Mix and Match Curtain Set 2 Piece Triangle Printed Blackout Curtains Pair Pink and 2 Piece White Tulle Lace Sheer Curtains for Girls Room wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOZsk882L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Available in 4 different size options (42x63 inch, 42x84 inch，52x63 inch, 52x84 inch), these amazing curtains enable you to mix and match. Your package will include 2 Printed blackout curtains and 2 elegant tulle lace white sheer curtains Each 52 inch wide curtain has 8 stainless silver grommets. Grommets are 1.6-inch in inner diameter and the exterior diameter is about 2.4 inches. This attractive combination will transform your living rooms or bedrooms. Combining the unique elegance, luxurious but simple effect of the Tulle lace white sheer curtains and the high quality looks of the blackout will make anyone who set eyes on them instantly love them. These blackout curtains are thermal insulated therefore energy-saving curtains and will prevent from heat escapes. They are also blackout ensuring light control and privacy when needed. While the sheers diffuses sunlight in stunning fashion letting you livens up the room with ambient light without sacrificing your privacy. For convenience, recommended hand wash. Wash below 86F. Do not bleach and do not tumble dry, low iron. Do not use fabric softener to protect the fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uOZsk882L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deconovo","source_asin":"B0774LGFWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0774LGFWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0774LGFWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823401,"name":"12 Inch Stainless Steel Skillet Frying Pan, Large Saute Pan with Lid and Stay-Cool Handle, 5qt Deep Sauté Pans for Saute Deep-Fry Braise Stew, Multipu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JryCSkVEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[5 Quart Multi-functional Pot ] ♥ There is measurement marks inside the stainless steel sauté pan present 5 quart, which is very convenient for accurate measurement.The diamater of the stainless steel saute pan with lid is 12 inch, it can be regarded as a multi-functional pan; such as a deep sauté pan with lid for sautéing vegetables, pasta and meat, a deep frying pan for pan-fried eggs, steak and pancakes, even a large sauce pan for large families to make sauces, and an cooking pot to cook meat soup [12 Inch Skillet with Lid] ♥ The 12 Inch saute pan is made of 18-10 premium stainless steel, the tri-ply impact-bonded base by casted with double stainless steel layers and an aluminium core layer to make the frying pan heat more distribute evenly and quickly when cooking. And due to the stable structure of stainless steel which features corrosion-resistant and oxidation-resistant, it can safely come into contact with food, which will not react with food [Dishwasher Safe] ♥ The large capacity stainless steel pan is easy to clean, it is dishwasher safe but we recommended to hand wash to protect the exquisite mirror surface.Please note, if surface of the pot looks like rainbow color after cooking many times, which is the oxidation phenomenon of stainless steel after being heated at high temperature, it is a normal physical reaction. You can use water and a little white vinegar (3:1), then heat the pot and wash it, finally use edible oil for care [Stay-Cool Handle] ♥ The joints of stainless steel pan and handle is reinforced by rivet technology which is firm and hard to fall off. When you grip handle you will feel it still stay cool when cooking due to design of hollow handle. And Sunken type pot lid design preserves the nutrition and reduces moisture loss effectively [Work on All Stoves] ♥ 5 quart stainless steel skillet with lid is very convenient to soups, stir-fries, and pasta etc. on all kinds of stoves such as electric, gas, ceramic, halogen and induction. It is also can use to make some desserts, pies, it is oven-safe up to 500℉","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JryCSkVEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe","source_asin":"B09ZQDZTBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQDZTBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQDZTBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
