window.products.push({"id":823423,"name":"Bear Pine Tree Black Sihouettes Window Valance Curtains, Window Treatment for Kitchen, Bathroom, Bedroom, Foggy Brown Beige Forest Rod Pocket Short Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DuvSghisL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create a sophisticate and elegant look for your home with exquisite pattern window curtain valance. This elegant window treatment valances provides a classic elegant look, and is perfect for living room, bedroom, dining room, kids room or any indoor and outdoor space of your home. Why you need a valance? A valance is a decorative piece of polyester fabric that you put at the top of your window for some more flair. This adds a little bit of extra style to your windows and can even block out some sunlight. Everyone's taste is their own but if you like the look of a valance, You can choose our valance. Frequently Asked Questions: 1. What's in the Package?1 Piece window curtain valance.2. What's the size per piece?The width is 54 inches, the length is 18 inches. You can see the dimensions in the picture above.3. Are the valance blackout?No, they're not blackout. They allow sunlight in and still provide privacy. Features: Soft and Durable:Constructed with a fine weight, microfiber polyester fabric ensures a valance that has a soft texture and smooth draping effect. Improved light blocking and thermal insulating, privacy protecting, noise reducing.Rod Pocket Top:Prevent bright beams of sun hurting your eyes as you wash and dry dishes, and set a bit of separation from your neighbors. Constructed with 1\" header and 3\" rod pocket,slips effortlessly across your curtain rod for quick, tool-free installation. Come and contact us if you have any questions or requests!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DuvSghisL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hokiten","source_asin":"B09F3DJXXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F3DJXXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F3DJXXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823424,"name":"Samson 6 in 1 Juicer GB9004 - Color:White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31wQInjjPqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Color: White Samson 6 in 1 Juicer: GB9004: The GB-9004 is basically the same machine as the classic Samson 6 in 1 juicer (GB-9001) with a few upgrades like a better auger and screen. It also has an upgraded look and includes some extras like nozzles, instructional DVD and juice cups. Samson Multi-Purpose Juicer: “Advanced” Series We continually work hard to produce high quality, functional, easy-to-operate and affordable juicers. Samson Brands is proud to introduce the Samson Advanced Multi-Purpose Line of Juicers. The new Samson Advanced juicer series incorporates newer, tougher and more efficient technology and materials that makes juicing a joy for new users as well as for juicing veterans that juice regularly. The Samson Advanced is easy and fun to use and clean. The Samson Advanced juice extractor is much more than just a simple juicer. Organic Wheatgrass Kit: Perfect for growing grasses even in small kitchens or apartments. Each kit comes with simple easy to follow growing and harvesting instructions that will have you juicing healthy super-nutritious juice within ten days! To insure the highest possible mineral content and grass yield, we have included an organic growing mix and Azomite, a natural mineral additive that insures that your grass contains all of the trace minerals required by the human body for maximum health. Includes: Growing Trays, Organic Seed, Trace Mineral Fertilizer, Wheatgrass Book, Growing & Juicing Instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31wQInjjPqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WheatGrassKits","source_asin":"B003P5QQQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003P5QQQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003P5QQQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
