window.products.push({"id":823430,"name":"Varomorus Soil Sampler Probe Stainless Steel Tubular T-Style Handle. (12 inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Bs+8dA7DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Provides 3/4\" x 6\" deep core: Designed with a one-piece solid T-style handle. The handle ensures easy inserting and extracting of the sampler while taking samples. The dimensions of the sampler: 12\" long and 3/4\" wide. Perfect for a quick inspection of soil characteristics: Perfect compact tool to determine your field condition, collect the dirt samples and check what your turf need. Compact solid design: Pocket size and light weight make it easy to carry on. Allows making a quick moisture inspection near your trees, plants, and lawn in your garden. An indispensable tool for patio, backyard, greenhouse, golf courts, parks: Extracts soil samples on all types of soil surfaces, even on clay land it makes a quick analysis of your topsoil for beautiful growing and landscaping results. Just make sure the sampling area is not too dry or hardened. Limited Lifetime warranty: We use Top Quality Stainless Steel and professional welding equipment. The probe has a premium finishing and is designed for long-lasting durability. At Varomorus we are standing for our products and providing a limited lifetime warranty on all stainless steel parts and welding works. Contact us with any concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Bs+8dA7DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Varomorus","source_asin":"B09G9TW2SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9TW2SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9TW2SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
