window.products.push({"id":823484,"name":"Jack Post Heavy Duty Welded Christmas Tree Stand - For Real Live Trees Up To 12' Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":164.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nbXAiFeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This tree stand is easy to use and can hold over a gallon of water to ensure your tree will always have enough to drink. All trees up to twelve feet can be displayed with this Christmas tree stand. With no tools necessary for setup you can have your gorgeous live tree up and ready for the holiday season in no time. Product Features:. Can be used for trees that have up to 6.25\" diameter trunks. Easy fill water bowl holds 1.7 gallons (6.4 Liters) of water. 4 heavy duty eye bolts hold tree in place. No tools needed for assembly. Heavy gauge welded steel will not crack or split. Textured powder coat finish, resists corrosion, adds durability Dimensions: 7\" high x 29.5\" wide Material(s): metal","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nbXAiFeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jack Post","source_asin":"B00337Q10A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00337Q10A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00337Q10A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823485,"name":"Leggett & Platt Sacramento Wood Bar Stool Black/Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JynPAfQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sacramento is a combination of strong wood, stylish accents and soft upholstery, resulting in a sophisticated addition to any dining area. A comfortable stool has always had a part in kids doing homework at the counter, keeping the cook company while dinner's being prepared, or the hours of great conversations with friends. With this in mind, the Sacramento has been designed with comfort in mind, and will provide a relaxing and inviting seat option for many years to come. Set includes: One (1) stool, assembly instructions Materials: Synthetic leather/ wood Dimensions: 21.5 inches long x 19 inches wide x 46 inches high, 19-inch wide seat Constructed of solid wood for strength and stability, this stool is paired with a hand-applied 6-step espresso wood finish and black faux leather upholstery to create a charming appeal. The square seat and seatback are lined with antique brass nailheads that add visual appeal, while the legs flare out ever so slightly to create an interesting contrast. Sacramento's swivel-seat has a rotating range of 180 degrees to make getting on and off easier and provide effortless turning to focus in other areas when needed. The 30-inch seat height could allow for under counter storage so you don't need to sacrifice a pathway or sightline in order to have additional seating. A 12-inch high footrest is provided to rest your heels and plays a very critical role in the comfort experienced by most adults. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett and Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products. Furniture Pattern: SolidFurniture Room: Bar, Dining Room, Kitchen, OfficeProduct Features: SwivelStyle: CasualMaterial: Faux Leather, WoodAssembly: Assembly RequiredSet Size: S","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JynPAfQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leggett & Platt","source_asin":"B00ORW3N92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ORW3N92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ORW3N92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
