window.products.push({"id":823527,"name":"Quntis Valentines Decorations Window Lights, 3 Star Battery Fairy Lights for Bedroom, 8 Mode Hanging Star Lights with Timer &Memory, Star Curtain Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817pLgKm7BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐[3 STARS LIGHT UP YOUR NIGHT] This crystal clear Valentine's Day window curtain stars light features a 3 stars design and each star shape light is made up of 10 warm white LEDs total of 30 LEDs for a great lighting effect. Hanging this LED starlight on your window, it looks like twinkling little stars in the night sky, very lovely, unique, and joyful. ⭐[8 LIGHTS MODES & TIMER FUNCTION] These star lights have 8 impressive light modes (combination, in a wave, sequential, slo glo, chasing /flash, slow fade, twinkle /flash, steady on), which can be controlled by the button on the wired controller. They also have timer and memory function options that allow turning on the lights automatically every day. ⭐[FREELY ADJUST TO WANTED LENGTH] Compare with other short lead wires, our LED curtain star string lights are designed with a longer 100cm /3.3ft lead wire with a 60cm /2ft horizontal length. 3 stars are connected by a 60cm /2ft long cable and hang down in different lengths of 75cm /2.5ft, 40cm /1.3ft and 60cm /2ft. The height of the stars can be adjusted freely to create a beautiful shape and warm atmosphere. ⭐[BATTERY-OPERATED FOR EASY & LONG USE] Star hanging window lights are powered by 3 AA batteries with no restriction by the power cord or USB plug, so you can hang them on a Christmas tree outside or place them on the bedroom window as a sleeping accompany. When you insert the batteries, they will be used continuously for more than 90 hours with low voltage and safe features. And the battery box is designed with a switch button to control the on/off, more convenient to use. ⭐[SIMPLE TO INSTALL AND HANG IN ANYWHERE] Provided with 4 clear adhesive hooks(installed on a clean and seamless surface), these fairy star string lights allow you to hang the 3-star lights and also hang the battery box separately, preventing falling with strong concealment. And the window star lights' battery box is designed with excellent performance with an IP44 waterproof rate, which means that even on little rainy days, stars can flash outdoors, very convenient and safe to place anywhere. ⭐[INDOOR OUTDOOR WIDE APPLICATION] Christmas window star curtain lights are perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations, widely used on Christmas, Thanksgiving, birthday parties, Valentine's Day, weddings, parties, holidays, etc. You can use it to decorate Christmas trees, fireplaces, homes, bedrooms, windows, doors, garlands, cabinets, and gift boxes as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817pLgKm7BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quntis","source_asin":"B0BGRTZF4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGRTZF4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGRTZF4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
