window.products.push({"id":823668,"name":"FSALS Flower Vases,4Pcs Fridge Vase Silicone Sticky Vase Reusable Wall-Mounted Vase Super Absorbent Magic Vase Suit for Home Kitchen Office Potted Wed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u84hpxVKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A touch of green can embellish your personal space, release your personal feelings, and make your home full of life. The fresh green blends into the elegant colors, just to let you relax in the tiring work, add warmth to the tidy home, and you can feel the feeling of being surrounded by nature at home. Enjoy the cozy, casual life. Why choose silicone vases? 1.Nano-scale polymer material, non-toxic and tasteless, green, and environmentally friendly. It has higher tear strength, cold and high-temperature resistance, long service life, and no deformation. 2.High-quality silicone vases, unlike ordinary vases, will not harm your children and your pets because of broken fragments. Better protect your family and at the same time decorate your house. 3.The non-marking silicone vase, the back is made of high-grade nanomaterials, like hundreds of thousands of suction cups, the adsorption force is extremely strong. After tearing off the vase, there will be no trace of glue on the wall, no need to make holes in the wall, and you will have a clean and tidy wall surface.. Product Size Length: 5.79inches(14.7cm) Width: 5.79inches(14.7cm) Instructions for use 1. Clean the smooth surface with a damp cloth 2. Tear off the sticker on the back of the silicone flower vase 3. Clean the back of the silicone vase with a damp cloth 4. Paste silicone vase 5. Inject 2/3 of freshwater into the vase 6. Insert flowers NOTE 1.Before pasting the flower vase, please clean the back of the vase and the wall with a damp cloth！ 2.Please be reminded that due to lighting effects and monitor's brightness/contrast settings etc, the color tone of the website's photo may different from the actual item's. 3.If there are any problems with the product, please contact us by email first, and we propose a satisfactory solution！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u84hpxVKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FSALS","source_asin":"B088Z1ZHM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088Z1ZHM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088Z1ZHM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
