window.products.push({"id":823689,"name":"Mountain Trades Universal Vacuum Hose Adapter Kit and Cone Reducers 7 Attachments Fits 7/8 in to 1 3/4 in Includes 1 Rubber Reducer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYIHRK4FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adapter Set For a Variety of Connections - 7 Adapters (NOTE- 2 Adapters come already connected together but come apart easily) Either use one adapter by itself or use a combination by connecting certain ones together to create an adapter that will fit your hose.( Not all the adapters will will plug into another one, some can only be used by themselves) We tested these on newer model vacuums and was able to come up with a combination that worked for most we could find. Both with older vacuums and newer ones measure your vacuum hose and attachment to check the size before purchase because we want you to be happy with your purchase. ** Just a note if you combine more than one adapter to fit a heavier floor attachment you might need a piece of tape to hold it on, just because of the weight when you pick it up and down often.**. You can even glue the pieces together. We have included one rubber adapter which is noted in the photos. The other adapters are made from plastic - 3 of them hard plastic and 3 from plastic that has some give in the material. Use these to connect your power tools vacuum port to your hose in your work shop or with your shop vacuums, also can use with dust collection systems. Please check the size first of your vacuum hose, also feel free to message us on Amazon and we will be glad to assist you any way we can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYIHRK4FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mountain Trades","source_asin":"B08C81ZC5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C81ZC5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C81ZC5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823690,"name":"Mary Meyer Print Pizzazz 6\" Piggy Bank Stripes Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SDFdk4CSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Mary Meyer's Print Pizzazz plush friends are made with custom printed soft fabrics, from stripes and dots to peace signs and flowers, there's a Print Pizzazz for everyone. Mary Meyer has been making toys that are safe and fun for more than 75 years, and have received numerous awards including multiple Oppenheim and Toy of the Year awards. As a young woman, Mary studied clothing design in New York City. In 1933, 29 year old Mary and her husband, Hans Meyer, put their talents together to design, manufacture, and sell tomato and animal pin cushions along with dolls. After several years they added stuffed toys. In the early 1940's, they moved the company to the beautiful Green Mountains of Vermont. Mary was active in the management of her business until 1982, retiring at the age of 78. After her retirement, she continued to be involved with the company. Through her 80s and into her 90s, she spent many hours in the company factory store. She loved to visit with teddy bear collectors and sign their Mary Meyer collector bears. Mary Meyer died in 1999 at 94 years of age. Known as \" Gram\" to family, friends, townspeople, employees and colleagues worldwide, Mary brought a sense of gentleness and graciousness to the toy industry. Fortunately, Mary's influence lives on. You can see it in over 400 different stuffed toy designs we offer. Following Mary's principles, we continually strive to design extraordinary products of outstanding quality, all the while keeping an eye on customer service and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SDFdk4CSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mary Meyer","source_asin":"B007J3ZXNU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007J3ZXNU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007J3ZXNU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823691,"name":"SodaStream Fizzi Sparkling Water Machine Bundle (White), with CO2, 1/2 Liter BPA-Free My Only Bottle, and 0 Calorie Fruit Drops Flavors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jg4FT6dUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fizzy sparkling water maker turns plain water into sparkling water in seconds. Designed to fit beautifully into any modern day home or office, It incorporates a slim, space saving design, without the use of any plugs or electricity. This model features the company's proprietary snap-lock technology that instantly \"clips\" In the BPA- free carbonating bottle for quick and easy carbonation. This kit includes the fizzy sparkling water maker, (1) 60L CO2 cylinder, (1) 1 liter BPA-free reusable carbonating bottles, (1) 1/2 liter BPA-free reusable carbonating bottle with strap and (2) 40 ml zero Calorie fruit drops – Lime and orange flavors. Everything needed to start sparkling today. Just add water!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jg4FT6dUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sodastream","source_asin":"B07ZHWV7HM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZHWV7HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZHWV7HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823692,"name":"O-heart Tree of Life Dream Catcher with Crystal, Black Dream Catcher, Feather Wall Hanging Decor with Healing Stones, Wall Decor for Bedroom Dorm Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C0RaAwZ9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tree of Life Dream Catcher: Inspired by the tree of life, this black feather dream catcher is mounted with gorgeous multi-gemstones, \"longevity stone\", symbolizing the tenacious life and the bright life, meaning good luck and positive energy. Dream catchers have beautiful symbols, praying for peace and good luck with you, driving out nightmares and beautifying your dreams Premium Quality Wall Hanging: The Life Tree dreamcatcher is Handmade and Artistic. Pure handmade by artisan in ethical condition and harmony with nature, safety for daily use, natural materials processed into exquisite handicrafts. It looks very delicate, the feather beautifully flutters when hanging it on. Hanging it on the wall as an elegant wall hanging, it will bring you happiness Elegant Home Decor: Ideal decoration for wall decor, home, office, garden, window, curtain, door, light, vestibule decoration, it promotes beauty, health, good luck and healing. Unique life tree pendant will keep you focused on your quest for awareness, knowledge and wisdom. Ideal Giftgiving Choice: Dream Catcher represents blessing, pray for peace and good luck. An ideal and gorgeous gift for yourself, family, kids, colleagues, friends, friends, lovers, someone undergoing nightmare and sufferings or others at any age. Perfect home décor, wall décor, bedroom hanging ornaments, door / window charm pendent Rainbow Crystals Dream Catcher Details: Ring diameter: 20cm / 8\", overall length 50cm / 20\" (included 5\" / 13cm hanging line). Crystal Ring diameter: 5cm / 2\". The weight of this wall decor is 120g. This tree of life dreamcatcher is firm and delicate, beautifully flutter when hanging it on. It is suitable for all occasions, whether it is wedding, party or home decoration","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C0RaAwZ9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O-heart","source_asin":"B08Z7YRH57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z7YRH57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z7YRH57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823693,"name":"Oriental Furnishings Dark Red Mahogany Porcelain Vase Stand (5.0\" W x 1.5\" H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Iv+AQzM5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Hand made wooden Chinese vase stand in semi matte finish for table top or floor use. Use these Oriental stands to showcase your collectables. This simple style will enhance the beauty of your object. We have a large selection of 17 sizes, from 3.5\" dia to larger 15.5 \". We use the inside dimension as measure from inner rim to rim. The carving is simple and we like using this simple \"ming\" style with ornate objects. Adding these wooden stands is a simple and elegant way to enhance your jar, vase or bowl.  Use larger sizes on the floor with your planters.* Ships USPS or Fed Ex* The lacquer finish use is extracted from natural plants* At least seven layers of lacquer will be applied on wood by hands. * Comes with center hole for lamp conversions* Dark red mahogany finish","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Iv+AQzM5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oriental Furnishings","source_asin":"B01MCR9852","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCR9852","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCR9852","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
