window.products.push({"id":823709,"name":"Howard Miller Chateau Floor Clock 610-520 – Windsor Cherry Vertical Home Decor with Chain-Driven, Single-Chime Movement & Chime Silence Option","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2549.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-EHmoh8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLOOR CLOCK: The Chateau Floor Clock has a Windsor Cherry finish on select hardwoods and veneers and is lightly distressed for an aged appearance to be ideal vertical decor in the home. The design includes a swan-neck pediment with turned finial and reeded finial seat. The design includes an elongated plain glass to see inside. DURABLE: This gorgeous floor clock has a sturdy wood frame with adjustable levelers to provide stability and relieve stress in a busy household. The polished brass finished dial contains an ornate, gold-tone center, silver-tone chapter ring, and a stationary midnight blue moon phase. CHIMES: Easily tell time with chain-driven, single-chime movement that plays the Westminster chime with a full chime and strike on the hour and chimes on the ¼, ½, and ¾ hour accordingly. Keep kids out with the convenient locking door. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 76.75 inches (195 cm), with a width of 19.5 inches (50 cm) and a depth of 11 inches (28 cm). Powered and operated by chain-driven, single-chime movement with a chime silence option. Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-EHmoh8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B0018K2RCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0018K2RCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0018K2RCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
