window.products.push({"id":823827,"name":"Wine Bottle Lights with Cork,LED 12 Pack Battery Operated Starry Fairy String Lights for Bottle, 6.56ft Copper Wire Decoration Lights for Christmas Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z6hbA7l4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wine bottle lights are perfect home decor supply, recycling your bottles with this wine bottle lights to create your home in a beautiful, warm and romantic atmosphere. GOOD POINTS: 1.The string of wine bottle lights is flexible, you can bend and shape it easily to decorate empty bottle and potted plants as you like.2.Compared to 10 led, 20 bottle lights with cork will have more sufficient brightness and longer copper wire.3. Colorful festival LED bottle light makes useless empty bottles into pretty nightlights. Using DIY bottle lights can recycle your wine bottles, glass bottles, beer bottles, soda bottle ect.4. The cork bottle lights is made of high-quality material and easy to store, and the bottle fairy lights has high brightness, low radiation and no pollution. How to Use the Wine Bottle Lights with Cork? Step 1: Please pull up the insulating strip after unpack and check the light; Step 2: Please turn on the switch above the cork \"ON/OFF\"; (If the product did not light up, please replace battery) Step 3: Please turn off the led string light if don't use it and insert the insulating strip to save battery life. SPECIFICATIONS: Type of Bulb: LED Color: 4 colorString Length: 6.56ft(2M)Total LED Bulbs Each Light: 20PCSDistance between Per LED Bulb: 10cm / 3.9inchMaterial: Copper String and PlasticFixture Features: Cordless, WirelessPower Source: Battery PoweredIncluded Components: Batteries included PACKAGE INCLUDES: 12 x Wine Bottle Lights ATTENTIONS: 1.Please pull out the white insulating strip before you turning on light.2.Please keep the cork away from water even the copper wire led is waterproof. Water can get inside the bottle. 100% QUALITY GUARANTEE 30 DAY BACK MONEY GUARANTEE - Please rest assured that you have made the right purchase. We will contact you at first time if you have any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z6hbA7l4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LABOREDUCER","source_asin":"B083FX8RXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083FX8RXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083FX8RXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
