window.products.push({"id":823919,"name":"HIARUO Faux Fur Throw Pillow Covers, Decorative Soft Pillow Cases, Square Cushion Cover for Sofa/Bed/Chair, Set of 2 (18'' x18'', Light-Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IchaQJGWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LUXURY BOTH SIDES FLUFFY FUR: This plush pillow cover made of high-quality rabbit faux fur with a cozy hand feeling, both sides have eco-friendly bushy hair with an ultra-soft comfortable feeling, it creates an elegant look. This fuzzy decorative pillow cover will add more grace to your space. DURABLE & EASY CARE & All-MATCH TYPE: The zipper is elegant and smooth.Via test,this pillow covers anti-fade and anti-shedding. It also anti-wrinkles,will offer the warmth and comfortable breathability. Ideal as your home couch pillow, sofa pillow, bed decor pillow, bar/party/office chair pillow, dorm pillow，wedding pillow and car pillow.This faux fur sherpa rabbit fur cushion cover can easily match with all styles of furniture. INVISIBLE ZIPPER & ENJOYABLE TOUCH: The 18x18 inch pillow cover is made with a color matching invisible zipper that allows easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts. So this fuzzy fluffy pillowcase is a great gift for your families, lover, friends, girl kids, pets, and gathering. This throw boho pillow for couch/sofa/living room/bed/car/office/bar/party will give you the most comfortable feeling when you are leaning against them,they will snugly hug you.You must will love it. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS: Machine wash or hand wash on gentle cycle with cold water or water below 30℃, dry off/hang to dry. Do not bleach, do not tumble dry, or do not iron. FRIENDLY USING NOTICE: Faux fur throw pillow covers 18x18 set of 2 only(that is,2pcs square pillowcases in total), inserts are not included. Shake helps to fluff out excess fluff when the throw pillows are fitted, please be careful not to clip the fluff when using the zipper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IchaQJGWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIARUO","source_asin":"B08LZQ6YGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZQ6YGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZQ6YGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
