window.products.push({"id":823991,"name":"Reusable Food Storage Bags, CUPAN 16 Pack Food Grade Reusable Freezer Bags Reusable Sandwich Bags BPA Free Reusable Gallon Bags Silicone Food Bags Dou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vGqhsC3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♻【Food GRADE MATERIAL & REUSABLE】：The reusable freezer bags can lock out freezer burn, perfect for storing and preserving food. We recommend hand wash, for the dishwasher will damage the double closure of the food storage bags. It is easy to clean with the bottle brushand let it air dry. ♻【Double Zipper Design】：Upgraded double closures ensure an airtight leakproof and seal, keeping food fresh and full of taste, With upgraded widened side and non-slip zipper design, it can be easily open and seal the snack bags. ♻【Environmental protection & Safety】This package includes 4 Stand-Up mega bags, 2 Stand-Up Mid bags, 4 Stand-Up Mini bags, 2 sandwich bags and 4 snack bags, which will meet your needs in various situations. Through certification tests, it is harmless to the environment when it is handled or burned. A reusable food storage bag can prevent the waste caused by using disposable plastic bags more than 300 times. It is healthy and safe for the family and the earth. ♻【MULTIPLE SIZE COMBINATIONS】：Different size food bags meet you different needs in daily life. There have flat and stand up 2 type bags, totally 5 size. Suits for kitchen, work, school, travel, picnic. ♻️【100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】Through certification tests, it is harmless to the environment when it is handled or burned. CUPAN provides all-day after-sales service, Any problem, you can just contact, we will provide you the professional solution and support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vGqhsC3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUPAN","source_asin":"B09J862JXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J862JXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J862JXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":823992,"name":"100% Organic Cotton Twin Fitted Sheet Dark Blue | Sateen Weave | 1 Piece | 300 Thread Count | GOTS Certified | Soft Silky Shiny| Luxury Finish | Fits ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OPlFIv5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DREAMY SLEEP & A SAFE PLANET GO HAND IN HAND- BERTHALINENS brings to you, it’s exquisite and ethically crafted 100% Organic Cotton – Twin Size, All Dark Blue, 1-Piece Sheet Set. This includes: 1 Fitted Sheet (39”x 75\"x15”). This just aint any other fitted sheet, instead it is a fruit of thoughtful efforts gone behind in crafting a careful ecosystem, through which we care for your dreamy sleep and also for our environment! MATERIAL & WEAVE: 100% Organic Cotton procured directly from farmers to make this beautiful fitted sheet in-house. This fitted sheet is made using Sateen WEAVE, which makes sheet silky and shiny. You would love it if you love a soft sleep! ORGANIC JOURNEY OF OUR PRODUCTS –We chose organic cotton (reduce water consumption, avoid harmful chemicals) from India and adopt a more natural way to grow cotton, which has a potential to reduce the insecticide usage globally by 25 percent. Organic Cotton goes to our production facility where it gets converted into yarn. Yarn is converted into fabric and fabric takes shape of final product. Unlike other Organic Brands, this complete process is in-house and organic at every stage. OBSESSED TO GETTING IT RIGHT- To ensure we are always doing the right things in the right manner, our entire production unit, cotton fields, supply chain, employee working conditions are put to a rigorous testing. We are GOTS Certified (A must have for any Organic Product), OEKO TEX CERTIFIED (We ensure a fairer price for the farmers ,higher wages for workers, better labor practices, respectful relationships, community development and respect for local culture) PRODUCT FOR EVERY OCCASION – This product is an ethical gifting choice for all your special occasions – Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, and Anniversaries. More than searching for any occasion, it is the best gift you can give to yourself, your family and to everyone who is a part of our ecosystem, striving to create a change! Happy Buying!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OPlFIv5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B08H4QM73Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-823992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4QM73Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4QM73Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
